          "_name": "list06",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list06\" group=\"List\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Position\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Date\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"List 1\" name=\"showList1\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"List 2\" name=\"showList2\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Bullet Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#edefeb\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                <b>Work Experience</b>\n            </h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\n            </h5>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center \">\n            <div class=\" col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                            <b>什麼是脊骨神經科</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            Stellar Corporation, January 2020 - December 2022<br>\n                        </h6>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                            <b>什麼是脊骨神經科</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>脊骨神經醫學是一個獨立的醫療體系，並非西醫的分科。香港註冊脊醫均畢業於美國、英國、加拿大、澳洲和紐西蘭的脊骨神經醫學院。脊醫的治療著重發揮人體自然復原能力，不用藥物與外科手術。\n</li><li>脊骨神經醫學的專業範疇包括：診斷、治療及預防因人體脊柱和骨骼系統、神經系統、肌腱系統與血液循環系統的相互運作功能產生不協調，所引起的功能性病症的一門醫療科學。\n</li><li>脊醫常見的脊骨神經科病症病頭痛、肩、頸、背、腰痛、手、腳痺痛，運動創傷導致的功能性痛症，勞損性創傷，脊柱側彎，坐骨神經痛，關節活動功能性失調（俗稱功能性關節錯位），姿勢不平衡所導致的痛症和兒童成長期間因神經、肌腱、骨骼系統的結構與功能不平衡所導致的功能性病症等。</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            <b>Achievements</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>Created a fresh logo for a prominent company that garnered positive feedback from\n                                    both its clientele and staff.</li>\n                                <li>Crafted a social media campaign resulting in over 1 million impressions.</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                Learn more</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                            <b>SMM Manager</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            Puppy Media, December 2021 - July 2022</h6>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                            <b>脊醫怎樣醫治病人</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>脊醫主要以脊骨神經醫學專業所持有等矯正學 (Adjustment)：關節手法治療 (Joint Manipulation) 尤其著重於以脊柱手法治療 (Spinal Manipulation) 平衡和保持脊椎關節和神經系統的活動機能對整體健康的完整性，更側重對關節活動功能性失調的矯正。\n</li><li>治理時脊醫會應用運動療法、營養學、物理醫療、軟組織療法等非藥物治療為病人提供更有效的預防與治療。有需要時脊醫會為病人作X光，MRI 或 CTScan 的影像診斷和醫療化驗，並作出適當的轉介。</li><li>\n</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            <b>Achievements</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>Designed and developed an advertising campaign.</li>\n                                <li>Increased social media engagement by 20%.</li>\n                                <li>Developed creative concepts for marketing campaigns that resulted in a 10% increase\n                                    in sales.</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                Learn more</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uZbFstOiHF",
          "_anchor": "list06-4",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "background-color": "@bgColor",
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-text, .item .mbr-section-btn": {
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "background": "@cardbg",
              "margin-bottom": "2rem",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem",
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding": "2.25rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "4rem"
              }
            },
            ".counter-container": {
              "ul": {
                "margin": "0",
                "padding-left": "2.25rem",
                "list-style": "none",
                "li": {
                  "position": "relative",
                  "list-style": "none",
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "&:before": {
                    "position": "absolute",
                    "left": "-1.5em",
                    "content": "\"\"",
                    "display": "flex",
                    "justify-content": "center",
                    "align-items": "center",
                    "color": "@iconColor",
                    "background-color": "@iconColor",
                    "width": "0.5em",
                    "height": "0.5em",
                    "top": "0.4em",
                    "border-radius": "50%"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text UL": {
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".mbr-card-subtitle": {
              "color": "#232323",
              "text-align": "left"
            }
          },
          "_name": "list06",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"list06\" group=\"List\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Position\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Date\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"List 1\" name=\"showList1\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"List 2\" name=\"showList2\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG\" name=\"cardbg\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Bullet Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#edefeb\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n            <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                <b>Work Experience</b>\n            </h3>\n            <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit.\n            </h5>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center \">\n            <div class=\" col-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 active\">\n                    <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 class=\"mbr-card-title mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b>What is Chiropractic</b></h5>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">The Power that made the Body heals the Body\n                        </h6>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            <b>Chiropractic</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>The Doctor of Chiropractic is an expert in detecting the abnormal position of spinal vertebrae. Chiropractor correct these misaligned positions called “Vertebral Subluxations” by delivering a safe, effective and specific force known as a Chiropractic Adjustment. Once the Subluxation is corrected, the patient's nervous system will be improved and will begin to express a higher quality of life.\n</li><li>I am often asked, “Will one adjustment be enough?” Why can’t this one adjustment hold and fully restore all tissues to their normal optimal state?” On the initial adjustment the vertebrae is returned closer to its normal position. The ligaments and muscles are given the opportunity to regain their normal tone and this permits them to hold the vertebrae in a more normal position.\n</li><li>The body and spine in particular are subjected to stress during the day and the vertebrae creeps back to its bad habit of misalignment. Your tissues must be rebuilt and revitalized for the vertebrae to hold their correct positions. The longer the problem has been present the more degeneration or disease state we see present. This means a longer period of rejuvenation might be necessary for healing. Improvement will start from your first treatment.\n</li><li>Time is an essential element on your road back to optimal health. Has the problem you are experiencing been present, a few days, weeks, months or years? The time it takes for your condition to heal is linked directly to this time line.\n</li><li>Repetition is the key to permanent correction of the Vertebral Subluxation. As a rule acute cases should respond rapidly and chronic cases are slower in response.\n</li><li>Energy is the part of the equation that holds your health together. Your body is constantly changing every moment you are alive! There are only two ways that your body can change in any moment: you can either get a little STRONGER, or get a little WEAKER. Remember that your brain controls and directs all parts of your body. Nothing in the body works unless it is connected to your brain. Therefore, if your spine is misaligned and putting pressure on the nerves, this reduces the life energy flow to your body, making you grow weaker, have pain, numbness and decreased body function. Spinal adjustments increase the life energy and promote longevity.\n</li><li>Time, Repetition and Energy is the formula for Optimal Health.</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li><li>\n</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <h6 class=\"mbr-card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mt-0 mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-card-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                            <b>Achievements</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <div class=\"counter-container mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-if=\"showList2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>Created a fresh logo for a prominent company that garnered positive feedback from\n                                    both its clientele and staff.</li>\n                                <li>Crafted a social media campaign resulting in over 1 million impressions.</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-white\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                                Learn more</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uZbGN3aQNG",
          "_anchor": "list06-5",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".google-map": {
              "height": "30rem",
              "position": "relative",
              "border-radius": "2rem",
              "iframe": {
                "height": "100%",
                "width": "100%",
                "border-radius": "2rem"
              },
              "[data-state-details]": {
                "color": "#6b6763",
                "height": "1.5em",
                "margin-top": "-0.75em",
                "padding-left": "1.25rem",
                "padding-right": "1.25rem",
                "position": "absolute",
                "text-align": "center",
                "top": "50%",
                "width": "100%"
              },
              "&[data-state]": {
                "background": "#e9e5dc"
              },
              "&[data-state=\"loading\"]": {
                "[data-state-details]": {
                  "display": "none"
                }
              }
            },
            ".content-head": {
              "max-width": "800px"
            }
          },
          "_name": "map01",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"map1\" group=\"Maps\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<header>Size</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n\t\t<header>Map</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"map\" title=\"Map\" name=\"googleMap\" place-id=\"<iframe src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3689.618611100301!2d114.05795697560832!3d22.368025240436662!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3403f95cd5111abb%3A0xbe881e719569e2c!2z6Zmz6KiY5buj5aC0!5e0!3m2!1szh-TW!2shk!4v1760064135148!5m2!1szh-TW!2shk&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;450&quot; style=&quot;border:0;&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer-when-downgrade&quot;></iframe>\" value=\"<iframe src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d3689.618611100301!2d114.05795697560832!3d22.368025240436662!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x3403f95cd5111abb%3A0xbe881e719569e2c!2z6Zmz6KiY5buj5aC0!5e0!3m2!1szh-TW!2shk!4v1760064135148!5m2!1szh-TW!2shk&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;450&quot; style=&quot;border:0;&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;no-referrer-when-downgrade&quot;></iframe>\">\n\t\t<header>Background</header>\n\t\t<fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n\t\t\t<input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n\t\t</fieldset>\n\t\t<header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\t<div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<b>Our office</b>\n\t\t\t\t\t</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFind us here\n\t\t\t\t\t</h4>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"google-map\" mbr-map=\"googleMap\"></div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "uZbHomZvpt",
