          "_name": "contacts01",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"contacts01\" group=\"Contacts\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"6\">2</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">4</option>\n\t\t</select>\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Cards</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitleCards\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"BG\" name=\"cardsBg\" value=\"#000000\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" checked condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 content-head\">\n                <div class=\"mbr-section-head mb-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showSubtitle\">\n                    <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n                        <b>聯絡我們</b>\n                    </h3>\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n                        Contacts Subtitle\n                    </h4>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-{{cardsWidth}} active\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                            <b>Phone</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">BACK2LIFE HK CHIROPRACTIC\n<br><br>梁子超 (脊醫) | Dr. Tim C. Leung\n<br>脊骨神經科醫生 | Doctor of Chiropractic\n<br>專治： 頸/腰/頭痛/及各種痛症</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\">\n                            <b>Email</b>\n                        </h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">診症時間\n<br>星期一至星期四 (上午十時至下午八時)\n<br>\n<br>Consultation Hours\n<br>Monday - Thursday (10:00am - 8:00pm)</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-{{cardsWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                        <h6 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\" mbr-if=\"showTitleCards\"><b>地址</b></h6>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\">新界深井青山公路42號陳記廣場地下F鋪\n<br>Shop F, G/F, 42 Castle Peak Road,\n<br>Sham Tseng, New Territories<br><br>Tel: 852 2891 6228\n<br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:Back2lifehealth@yahoo.com\" class=\"text-primary\">Back2lifehealth@yahoo.com</a>\n<br>Website: www.Back2lifehkchiropractic.com<br></p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
